    "At have spist en meget sund og nærende morgenmad, der giver energi.": "To have eaten a very healthy and nutritious breakfast that gives energy.",
    "At føle sig helt rask, vågen og fuld af god, frisk energi.": "To feel completely healthy, awake, and full of good, fresh energy.",
