    "At have overvundet en svær tid og nu endelig kunne puste lidt ud.": "To have overcome a difficult time and now finally be able to catch one's breath.",
    "At se meget træt, elendig og medtaget ud, så alle kan se, at man har det skidt.": "To look very tired, miserable, and battered, so everyone can see that one is not doing well.",
